{"id":"ab1164e8495d4ee1","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-glb-box-absorption.md","title":"GLB Box Absorption across Ordinal Exponents","display":"lem-glb-box-absorption — GLB Box Absorption across Ordinal Exponents","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-glb-box-absorption","aliases":["89-lem-glb-box-absorption"],"display":"lem-glb-box-absorption — GLB Box Absorption across Ordinal Exponents","depends_on":["[[89-df-glb-logic]]","[[89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-glb-box-absorption"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-glb-box-absorption</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-glb-box-absorption — GLB Box Absorption across Ordinal Exponents"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8de2ffea9eb2c928\" href=\"?note=8de2ffea9eb2c928\" title=\"89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas\">89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a> 的双模态定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,i\\in\\omega\">\\(j,i\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}box\\text{-}absorption}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\Box_0(\\Box_0B\\lor C_j)\\to(\\Box_0B\\lor C_i)\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{GLB}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}box\\text{-}absorption}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\Box_0(\\Box_0B\\lor C_j)\\to(\\Box_0B\\lor C_i)\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{GLB}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 p.214，Lemma 3。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>由单调交互得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0(\\Box_0B\\lor C_j)\\to\\Box_1(\\Box_0B\\lor C_j)\">\\(\\Box_0(\\Box_0B\\lor C_j)\\to\\Box_1(\\Box_0B\\lor C_j)\\)</span>。负内省交互给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box_0B\\to\\Box_1\\neg\\Box_0B\">\\(\\neg\\Box_0B\\to\\Box_1\\neg\\Box_0B\\)</span>，故在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box_0B\">\\(\\neg\\Box_0B\\)</span> 条件下合并 K 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_1C_j=C_{j+1}\">\\(\\Box_1C_j=C_{j+1}\\)</span>。第二盒导出 4，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j+1\\le i\">\\(j+1\\le i\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{j+1}\\to C_i\">\\(C_{j+1}\\to C_i\\)</span>。按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0B\">\\(\\Box_0B\\)</span> 真/假作命题分情况即可。</p>\n<p>这正是原书 Lemma 3，包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j=0\">\\(j=0\\)</span>，不把两盒当成相同算子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excer